                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Schimpfwort für einen (Ost-)Asiaten oder Menschen mit asiatischem Aussehen und/oder Abstammung, jedoch meist nicht für die aus Asien eingewanderten amerikanischen Ureinwohner"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea8013e1-fb09-4af4-a7d0-79b26cc7836e",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee4bffe-42d9-3655-b22f-9e1aaa4c9285",
                                                "text": "Die Bezeichnung Schlitzauge wird abwertend für Asiaten, meist für Chinesen, Japaner oder Vietnamesen verwendet."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "205d7bf7-1ce3-3446-97f6-2e01549b97d1",
                                        "entry_id": "716eef16-7a7d-322b-94b8-d5ef7a3a02fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine bestimmte Form des menschlichen Auges, Epikanthus medialis"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6dfcb1ac-f3b8-4b37-b416-c7c02fafb0af",
                                                "sense_id": "205d7bf7-1ce3-3446-97f6-2e01549b97d1",
                                                "text": "Es wird oft fälschlicherweise vermutet, dass Schlitzaugen das Sichtfeld einschränken."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a873e057-8145-4f9c-b07b-4d5d7b452933",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b2a2702-1f96-3a20-914f-e01882edd416",
                        "source_sense_id": "250366d6-7839-361a-a166-bfaaa2105f2f",
                        "target_lang_word": "Chink",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Chink",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d23a33c-68b7-3d4f-b012-85aebee98573",
                                        "entry_id": "b602cdb5-b80a-33d8-bf50-a23cf194d961",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person of perceived Chinese ethnicity or descent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "ethnic",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "slur"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cbf9dfda-195b-4552-a02a-e320a17a313e",
                                                "sense_id": "5d23a33c-68b7-3d4f-b012-85aebee98573",
                                                "text": "Then her eyes, always alert for the affairs of her kitchen, fell on some action of the Chinese cook which aroused her violent disapproval. She turned on him with a torrent of abuse. The Chink was not backward to defend himself, and a very lively quarrel ensued."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "635a4542-3f4b-405c-a54d-e8cb8be35b9e",
                                                "sense_id": "5d23a33c-68b7-3d4f-b012-85aebee98573",
                                                "text": "[Ignatz Mouse:] A new Chink in town, and acting mighty queer too – I suspect foul play."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b381671b-5b8e-4784-9596-a67d45a4acbe",
                                                "sense_id": "5d23a33c-68b7-3d4f-b012-85aebee98573",
                                                "text": "He scratched his head. \"Well, damn me,\" said he. \"I never thought I would take orders from a Chink, but he says 'hist!' and by crums you've got to hist and no back talk either.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84a61241-3ec3-3d46-acfc-b65795aef1ee",
                                        "entry_id": "b602cdb5-b80a-33d8-bf50-a23cf194d961",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person of perceived East Asian descent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "ethnic",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "slur"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de99663c-254b-32a1-9e58-e1707e086b9d",
                                        "entry_id": "b602cdb5-b80a-33d8-bf50-a23cf194d961",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A meal of Chinese food."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ethnic",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "slur"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67bfc2f8-4365-4a2c-afef-34b576e229c7",
                                                "sense_id": "de99663c-254b-32a1-9e58-e1707e086b9d",
                                                "text": "Let's order some Chink. Where's that menu? I think we've got the stuff we usually order circled. I'm starved!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Chink",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
